Run Alembic commands from backend/ with the configured direct/session database URL.

Show the repository's migration head and the connected database revision:

    uv run --locked alembic heads
    uv run --locked alembic current

Render offline SQL without connecting to the database:

    uv run --locked alembic upgrade head --sql

Without an explicit starting revision, offline mode renders the full chain from
base, not just the connected database's pending migrations. Review the appropriate
revision range before applying.

Apply reviewed migrations to the configured database:

    uv run --locked alembic upgrade head

See ../../../docs/guides/backend-setup.md for migration authoring and setup.
